ry drainage infrastructure. Recent heavy rainfall unveiled severe waterlogging in Bopal, Ghuma, and Shela, prompting authorities to reassess project approvals. This initiative aims to curb future flooding risks and enhance urban development. Major investments are already taking place to tackle these pressing infrastructure challenges.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/ahmedabad-building-permission-may-be-denied-if-areas-drainage-is-patchy/133141969?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-43508/133141969.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}